  "description": "The Weekender Drop sits at the top of the Weekender line. It ties together an excellent parts kit with our versatile Weekender frame and fork. The Drop is a true 10-speed with a dynamic range thanks to the 11-40t rear cassette.\n\nSRAM’s Apex lever easily shifts through the gears and the SRAM X7 Type 2 rear derailleur provides an extremely solid feel to the drive train. Avid BB7 road disc brakes paired with our Fairdale Linear cables (by Odyssey) stop with authority. 42mm wide Continental tires roll smoothly on our sealed cartridge bearing hubs. 2-Piece cranks with an over-sized spindle have been paired to a sealed, outboard bearing bottom bracket so you can put all of your power to use. The frame and fork comes equipped with rack and fender mounts that allow for lots of set-up options. Enjoy the Weekender Drop and its fantastic range of uses.",
